# RecoveryOS

AI-powered revenue recovery agent for Razorpay merchants.

## Problem

Merchants lose revenue through failed payments, checkout abandonment,
subscription failures and overdue receivables.

RecoveryOS detects revenue at risk, determines an appropriate recovery
intervention, executes bounded recovery workflows, verifies the outcome,
and records an auditable trail.

## Core Flow

Detect → Diagnose → Decide → Guardrail → Act → Verify → Audit

## Technology

- Python
- Razorpay Test APIs
- Supabase / PostgreSQL
- Ollama
- Trigger.dev
- n8n
- Next.js / Vercel
- GitHub

